Code
- index.html, mix.py, build.sh: written for claude-Utube (the studio's own demo of its learned style).
  They follow the page, mixer and build contracts of the lemo-opuscar library (TECHNIQUE.md) and call its
  files at run time: /core/lib.js, /core/three/post.js, core/audio/sfx.py, core/tts/tts.py,
  core/render/video.mjs, core/render/mux.sh. The mixer's structure (bed, foley, ducking, compress, limit)
  is adapted from the library's examples. Licence of that code:

